  m_Name: LorePart1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LoreData
  title: REPORT N.1936565
  loreText: "Year 1995, the city of Mirny.\n\nAt that time, Soviet engineers succeeded
    in automating diamond mining in the Mir crater using humanoid robots. During
    the diamond extraction operations, a previously unknown and peculiar dark-purple
    substance was discovered. It possessed incredible properties unlike anything
    humanity had ever seen before. The origin of this substance was unknown at the
    time...\n\nThe substance was named Mirium, after the city where it was found.
    It was known that Mirium could lift objects of various weights into the air,
    whether a small stone or a massive ship. Neither civilians, scientists, nor soldiers
    could resist the temptation to use these abilities for their own\u2014perhaps
    not always noble\u2014purposes, until one tragic incident...\n\nA worker was
    brought to the infirmary who frequently complained of hearing strange sounds,
    as if distorted speech. The doctors decided to give him a day off. However, by
    the very next day, new symptoms appeared\u2014violent fits of aggression, panic
    attacks, muttering, and insomnia. The same symptoms gradually began appearing
    in more and more employees of the facility. The doctors had no idea that Mirium
    was behind it all...\n\nThere were also increasing reports that the robots were
    behaving differently from how they were supposed to."
